DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260521T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260521T150000
SUMMARY:How to grow your small donors | RJI Community Conversation
DESCRIPTION:Join Innovation Team Project Manager Sriya Reddy (https://rji
 online.org/person/sriya-reddy/) in conversation with Kimberly Griffin and
  Penny Riordan to talk about small dollar donors and best practices to gr
 ow them.  Speakers:Kimberly Griffin (https://www.linkedin.com/in/kimberly
 dgriffin) helps nonprofit newsrooms close the gap between strategy and re
 sults. From CRM implementation to major donor cultivation and membership 
 growth\, she rolls up her sleeves alongside small teams to get fundraisin
 g programs off the ground and generate revenue.Penny Riordan (https://www
 .davidarkinconsulting.com/about/#penny) is an audience\, product\, and te
 chnology leader with more than 20 years of experience working for and wit
 h local media organizations. She is currently helping local media compani
 es solve their biggest challenges in audience\, tech stack\, newsletters 
 and revenue working as a fractional consultant with David Arkin Consultin
 g.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Join Innovation Team Project Manager <a
  href="https://rjionline.org/person/sriya-reddy/">Sriya Reddy</a> in conv
 ersation with Kimberly Griffin and Penny Riordan to talk about small doll
 ar donors and best practices to grow them.<br /><br />  Speakers:<br /><a
  href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kimberlydgriffin">Kimberly Griffin</a>
  helps nonprofit newsrooms close the gap between strategy and results. Fr
 om CRM implementation to major donor cultivation and membership growth\, 
 she rolls up her sleeves alongside small teams to get fundraising program
 s off the ground and generate revenue.<br /><br /><a href="https://www.da
 vidarkinconsulting.com/about/#penny">Penny Riordan</a> is an audience\, p
 roduct\, and technology leader with more than 20 years of experience work
 ing for and with local media organizations. She is currently helping loca
 l media companies solve their biggest challenges in audience\, tech stack
 \, newsletters and revenue working as a fractional consultant with David 
 Arkin Consulting.</p>
